member.summary:
SystemDirPath return system directory path, 
if defined in App.Config, 
otherwise applcation directory of base exe.

member.param:
default , 
            if , then first occurence in main main.IndexOf(patternStart) will be executed, 
            otherwise if , then main.LastIndexOf(patternStart) will be executed.

default 
            if , then last occurence main.LastIndexOf(patternEnd) will be executed,
            otherwise if , then first occurence in main main.IndexOf(patternEnd) will be executed.
